<!-- ════════════════ 38 · EXAMPLE · REASONING ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Example: reasoning" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #7c3aed;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">38</span>Example</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Set the <span class="accent">effort</span> low for simple work.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 32px; align-content: start;">

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-claude"></i>Anthropic</span>
          <div class="ide ide-claude">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">request</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="key">"output_config"</span>: {
  <span class="key">"effort"</span>: <span class="str">"low"</span>
}</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">low to max; lower = fewer thinking tokens.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-openai"></i>OpenAI</span>
          <div class="ide ide-openai">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">request</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="key">"reasoning_effort"</span>:
  <span class="str">"low"</span></pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap"><code>none</code> for latency-critical work.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-gemini"></i>Google Gemini</span>
          <div class="ide ide-gemini">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">request</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="key">"thinkingConfig"</span>: {
  <span class="key">"thinkingLevel"</span>:
    <span class="str">"minimal"</span>
}</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">Gemini 3; 2.5 uses thinkingBudget.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Anthropic: &ldquo;<strong>Tuning effort is often a better lever than switching models.</strong>&rdquo; Fewer thinking tokens, lower bill.
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;"><strong>Sources:</strong> Anthropic effort &amp; choosing-a-model (platform.claude.com) &middot; OpenAI reasoning guide &middot; Gemini thinking (ai.google.dev).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "38" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "57" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
